author=Vael
description=Universal camera & lens switch fix for garnet (Poco X6 5G / Redmi Note 13 Pro 5G): native Photo/Video SAT lens switching, smooth 0.6x-5x zoom, surgical Titan570 Luma-only NR bypass (ANR101 YLPF/DCBlend2 + TF201 Y=0 while keeping 100% Chroma NR clean, Edge=OFF, sharpness=0), active 0.6x UltraWide LDC, boosted H.264/HEVC video bitrates, and FHD60 with auto UW 30fps clamp.
